    "title": "Career Opportunity Financial Analyst at Walker Chandiok Capital India",
    "description": "Walker Chandiok Capital India is actively seeking a talented and motivated Financial Analyst to join our dynamic team in Vijayawada. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Walker Chandiok Capital India:\nWalker Chandiok Capital India is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage accounts payable and accounts receivable functions\n• Prepare annual reports and investor presentations\n• Liaise with banks, regulators, and financial institutions\n• Monitor financial performance against targets and provide variance analysis\n• Prepare and analyze financial statements, reports, and budgets\n• Monitor market trends and provide investment recommendations\n• Coordinate with external auditors during annual audits\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• BPharm / MPharm / PharmD\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Ind AS\n• Proficiency in IFRS\n• Proficiency in Income Tax\n• Proficiency in SAP FICO\n• Proficiency in Power BI\n• Proficiency in Budgeting\n• Proficiency in VBA\n• Proficiency in GST\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Referral bonus program\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Learning & development budget\n• Flexible working hours\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Walker Chandiok Capital India!",
